'''Lady Selind's Purse''' is acquired by interacting with the [[Dragon Vault]] in [[Northwind]] while in possession of [[Perfumed Letter (4)|Perfumed Letter #4]] and the [[Violet Key]]. When returned to [[Gertrud Selind]], the player is rewarded with a [[Lavishly Crafted Purse]], a unique 12-slot back.

